{"seq":3,"slug":"traceability-batch-genealogy-query","title":"批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/traceability-batch-genealogy-query","wordCount":2911,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询\">批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询</h1><p>一家跨境小家电卖家从华南工厂拿到 3200 台空气炸锅，工厂把同一批发热管装进了三个不同的出口批次（一个发德国、一个发美国、一个留在国内电商仓）。三个月后，欧洲 Safety Gate 通报某型号过热起火，通报指向的正是那批发热管的供应商。此刻真正要回答的不是「哪个批次有问题」——监管已经给了批次号——而是**「那批发热管还流进了哪些成品批次、装进了哪些箱和托盘、发到了哪些仓库和渠道、还有多少台在消费者手里」<strong>。这就是</strong>受影响范围查询（affected-scope query）**：沿着一条已确定的缺陷批次，把溯源图上所有下游节点一次性拎出来。它决定召回的实物盘点、渠道通知清单和法定上报口径，也是召回成本估算的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-批次标识-谱系边与溯源图\">核心概念：批次标识、谱系边与溯源图</h2><p>溯源的物理基础是<strong>批次标识（lot/batch identifier）</strong>。欧盟《通用产品安全条例》（Regulation (EU) 2023/988，GPSR）第 9(4) 条要求产品「带有型号、批次或序列号，或其他可识别要素」；美国 FDA 的《食品安全现代化法》第 204 条最终规则则把可追溯批号明确为 <strong>Traceability Lot Code（TLC）</strong>——「一个通常为字母数字、用于唯一标识可追溯批次的描述符」，在初次包装、首批陆基收货或转化时分配，并出现在此后每一个关键追踪事件（CTE）的记录中（来源：FDA, FSMA 204 Food Traceability Final Rule）。标识本身不值钱，<strong>把标识连成有向图</strong>才值钱。</p>\n<p>溯源图有两类边，方向相反、用途互补：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[原料批次&lt;br/&gt;发热管 Lot-R] --&gt; T[转化事件&lt;br/&gt;组装成整机]&#10;    T --&gt; F1[成品批次 A&lt;br/&gt;欧盟订单]&#10;    T --&gt; F2[成品批次 B&lt;br/&gt;美国订单]&#10;    T --&gt; F3[成品批次 C&lt;br/&gt;国内仓]&#10;    F1 --&gt; G1[聚合事件&lt;br/&gt;箱 40 台 / 托盘 480 台]&#10;    F2 --&gt; G2[聚合事件&lt;br/&gt;箱 24 台 / 托盘 288 台]&#10;    G1 --&gt; D1[发货事件&lt;br/&gt;汉堡 DC]&#10;    G2 --&gt; D2[发货事件&lt;br/&gt;洛杉矶 DC]&#10;    D1 --&gt; C1[渠道&lt;br/&gt;自建站 / 亚马逊 DE]&#10;    D2 --&gt; C2[渠道&lt;br/&gt;亚马逊 US / TikTok Shop]\">flowchart TD\n    S[原料批次&lt;br/&gt;发热管 Lot-R] --&gt; T[转化事件&lt;br/&gt;组装成整机]\n    T --&gt; F1[成品批次 A&lt;br/&gt;欧盟订单]\n    T --&gt; F2[成品批次 B&lt;br/&gt;美国订单]\n    T --&gt; F3[成品批次 C&lt;br/&gt;国内仓]\n    F1 --&gt; G1[聚合事件&lt;br/&gt;箱 40 台 / 托盘 480 台]\n    F2 --&gt; G2[聚合事件&lt;br/&gt;箱 24 台 / 托盘 288 台]\n    G1 --&gt; D1[发货事件&lt;br/&gt;汉堡 DC]\n    G2 --&gt; D2[发货事件&lt;br/&gt;洛杉矶 DC]\n    D1 --&gt; C1[渠道&lt;br/&gt;自建站 / 亚马逊 DE]\n    D2 --&gt; C2[渠道&lt;br/&gt;亚马逊 US / TikTok Shop]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>转化边（transformation edge）</strong>：输入批次 → 输出批次，表达「A 被做成 B」。因为一次组装会消耗多批原料、产出一个成品批，这是一张<strong>多对多多层 DAG</strong>，不是树。</li>\n<li><strong>聚合边（aggregation edge）</strong>：表达「多少个单位被装进同一个容器」，从单件到箱、箱到托盘、托盘到集装箱。它记录的是<strong>容器的层级（parent-child）</strong>，不改变物料成分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两类边必须分开建模：召回判定沿<strong>转化边</strong>传播（发热管有问题 → 整机有问题），实物清点与物流拦截沿<strong>聚合边</strong>传播（整机批次 → 哪些托盘能整托拦下）。把两者压进一张「父子表」，查询时会把「同一箱里两台不同批次机器」误判成因果关系。GS1 的 <strong>EPCIS 2.0</strong> 正是为「跨企业共享可见性事件数据」而设计，定义了 ObjectEvent、AggregationEvent、TransformationEvent、TransactionEvent 四类事件，其中 AggregationEvent 描述容器父子关系、TransformationEvent 描述输入输出转化；EPCIS 2.0 与配套的 Core Business Vocabulary（CBV）2.0 于 2022 年 6 月由 GS1 批准，2.1 版计划 2026 年底发布（来源：GS1 EPCIS 标准页 / EPCIS 2.0 条目）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>溯源事件</th>\n<th>表达的关系</th>\n<th>召回中的用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ObjectEvent</td>\n<td>某批次在何时何地处于何状态</td>\n<td>库存与在途定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AggregationEvent</td>\n<td>容器装了多少单位（父子）</td>\n<td>整箱/整托拦截与清点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TransformationEvent</td>\n<td>输入批次 → 输出批次</td>\n<td>缺陷传播与召回判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TransactionEvent</td>\n<td>批次的所有权/持有权转移</td>\n<td>责任链与渠道通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"谱系建模-从批次表到可遍历的图\">谱系建模：从批次表到可遍历的图</h2><p>落进数据库，谱系最忌用「一张带 parent_lot 列的表」硬编码单亲关系——多对多转化会立刻把它撑爆。可行模型是<strong>事件表 + 派生邻接表</strong>：原始事件按 EPCIS 风格落 <code>trace_event(event_id, type, when, where, biz_step, disposition)</code>，参与方落 <code>trace_epc(event_id, epc, role)</code>，<code>role</code> 区分 <code>input</code>/<code>output</code>/<code>child</code>/<code>parent</code>。再由物化视图派生两张边表 <code>transform_edge(src_lot, dst_lot, event_id)</code> 与 <code>aggregate_edge(parent_container, child_unit, event_id)</code>。这样原始事件是<strong>不可变的证据</strong>（监管问询时「当时录了什么」可原样回放），邻接表是<strong>可重建的查询加速结构</strong>，两者解耦——重算谱系不丢证据。</p>\n<p>批次标识本身也是坑。GS1 体系里批次可挂在 GTIN 上（<code>GTIN + lot</code>），也可用 SGTIN 精确到单件，跨境场景还常混入工厂自有批号、平台 SKU、海关商品编码。工程纪律是<strong>每条边两端都存「原始标识 + 归一化键」双份</strong>：归一化键（优先 GTIN+lot，缺失降级到 SKU+型号+工厂批号）用于图遍历，原始标识用于向监管和渠道回示。归一化键一旦算错，会把两个不同批次的发热管合并——这比漏合并危险，因为误合并会人为放大召回范围，触发不必要的下架与行政成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受影响范围查询-图遍历与爆炸半径\">受影响范围查询：图遍历与爆炸半径</h2><p>确定了缺陷批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 之后，受影响范围是它在<strong>转化边</strong>上的下游可达闭包：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⇝</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mtext>transform</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}(b) = \\{\\, v \\mid b \\rightsquigarrow v \\,\\} \\;=\\; \\mathrm{reach}^{+}_{\\text{transform}}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⇝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1128em;vertical-align:-0.2571em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">reach</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4429em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transform</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2571em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 出发沿转化边有向可达的全部成品批次。库存与物流侧则在同一批节点上叠加聚合边求容器闭包。真实实现用<strong>递归 CTE</strong>（PostgreSQL <code>WITH RECURSIVE</code>）或图引擎（Neo4j、Amazon Neptune）做传递闭包；跨境规模通常每条边记录在千万级、深度 5–8 层，递归 CTE 配 <code>src_lot</code> 索引即可，无需上图数据库，但<strong>必须设遍历深度上限</strong>——供应链出现环（重贴标、退料回用）时无界递归会打爆查询。</p>\n<p>拿到范围后，估算<strong>受影响实物量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>U</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{U} = \\sum_{u \\in \\mathcal{A}(b)} q(u)\\cdot \\alpha(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的产出数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha(u)\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是「仍在流通/在消费者手中」的比例（已售出、未退货、未报废）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是最难也最关键的一项：它决定了召回的实物难点是「仓库拦截」还是「消费者回收」，两者成本与话术完全不同。实际可拆成渠道维度——平台仓在库的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0（可直接冻结），直面消费者（DTC）销售的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 高得多。</p>\n<p>召回范围的<strong>精度权衡</strong>同样要显式量化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为实际有问题单位集合、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为查询判定的召回集合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>precision</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{precision} = \\frac{|R \\cap S|}{|R|},\\qquad \\text{recall} = \\frac{|R \\cap S|}{|S|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨境召回的监管现实是<strong>偏向高 recall</strong>：漏召回的合规与人身风险远大于扩大召回的商业成本。因此查询默认走「宁可多不可漏」的宽口径（比如把时间窗放宽、把归一化键降级匹配也算命中），但要把宽口径多出的部分标成 <code>candidate</code>（待人工研判）而非直接 <code>recall</code>，让扩大召回成为<strong>可解释的显式决策</strong>，而不是查询逻辑的副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨法域追溯合规-记录哪些边-留多久\">跨法域追溯合规：记录哪些边、留多久</h2><p>谱系不只是内部工具，它有<strong>法定最小集</strong>。三家主要法域的强制口径不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>追溯义务载体</th>\n<th>关键要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>GPSR 第 9(4) 条、第 14(1)–(2) 条</td>\n<td>产品须带批次/序列标识；经济运营者须能识别谁供货、供给了谁，记录<strong>保存 10 年</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国（食品）</td>\n<td>FSMA 204 最终规则</td>\n<td>在 7 类关键追踪事件（收获/冷却/初次包装/首批陆基收货/发货/收货/转化）留存 KDE，全部挂到 TLC；疫情或召回时<strong>24 小时内</strong>出具可电子排序的表格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国（消费品）</td>\n<td>CPSC 召回库</td>\n<td>召回记录按危险类型、救济方式（refund/repair/replace/dispose）等受控词汇切分，数据集回溯至 1973 年、按周更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（来源：GPSR Regulation (EU) 2023/988 第 9、14 条；FDA FSMA 204 Food Traceability Final Rule；CPSC Recalls 库说明。）注意 FSMA 204 的合规日期：原定 2026 年 1 月 20 日，FDA 已提议推迟 30 个月至 <strong>2028 年 7 月 20 日</strong>，2026 财年拨款立法亦指示 FDA 在该日期前不予执法——建系统时不要把「2026 年 1 月已生效」写进设计假设（来源：FDA 规则页）。</p>\n<p><strong>「保存 10 年」不是「表里留着」</strong>：GPSR 第 14 条要的是能按批次回答「上游是谁、下游是谁」的<strong>可查询记录</strong>，一旦归一化后丢掉原始标识或事件时间，10 年后无法应答等于没存。因此事件表与边表都要有<strong>不可变、可按批次反查</strong>的索引，并保留 <code>occurred_at</code>（事件发生）与 <code>recorded_at</code>（录入系统）两个时间——召回时效评估看的是前者。## 查询工程：反向溯源、正向分发与证据链</p>\n<p>生产上至少两类查询要同时可用。<strong>反向溯源（trace-back）</strong>：给一个成品批次或已售单位，问「它用了哪些原料批次」——沿转化边逆走，用于接到消费者投诉后定位嫌疑原料。<strong>正向分发（trace-forward）</strong>：给一个缺陷原料批次，问「它去了哪些成品、渠道、国家」——用于确定通知清单和法域上报。两者都是同一张图的传递闭包，只是方向相反，<strong>必须共用同一份边表和归一化键</strong>，否则反查与正查会给出不一致的答案，监管面前无法自证。</p>\n<p>查询结果必须绑定<strong>证据链</strong>：每条命中的下游批次要能回指到具体 EPCIS 事件（<code>event_id</code>）、事件时间、参与方，而不只是给一个批次号。召回通报要写「受影响范围依据 XX 发货事件」，监管或平台申诉时这正是举证材料。同时保留<strong>查询快照</strong>：某次召回判定时刻的闭包结果要落盘留档，因为供应链数据会持续更新，事后再跑同样的查询结果可能已变。</p>\n<p>还有一条反直觉的纪律：<strong>谱系图要允许「未知边」</strong>。跨境链路里常有二级供应商、代工贴标、无法回填的旧批次。与其让缺失的边等于「无下游」，不如显式标记 <code>unknown_consumer</code>，让查询在断链时返回「存在未知下游，需人工追查」，而不是静默给出一个偏小的范围——召回场景里，<strong>沉默的漏项比响亮的告警贵得多</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>两类边、两个方向</strong>：转化边管「缺陷怎么传播」，聚合边管「实物怎么拦截」，压进一张父子表必然出错。</li>\n<li><strong>事件表 + 派生邻接表</strong>：EPCIS 风格原始事件是不可变证据，邻接表是可重建的加速结构，重算谱系不丢证据。</li>\n<li><strong>受影响范围 = 下游可达闭包</strong>：递归 CTE 或图引擎算传递闭包，必须设深度上限；受影响量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>U</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat U=\\sum q\\cdot\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（仍在流通比例）是最关键参数。</li>\n<li><strong>宽召回偏 recall</strong>：多召回的边际合规风险低于漏召回；把宽口径多出的部分标 <code>candidate</code>，让扩大召回成为显式决策。</li>\n<li><strong>合规最小集有法域差异</strong>：GPSR 第 9(4)/14 条要求批次标识与 10 年可查询记录；FSMA 204 要求 7 类 CTE 的 KDE 挂 TLC、24 小时出表（合规日期已提议推迟至 2028-07-20）；CPSC 召回库按受控词汇切分、按周更新。</li>\n<li><strong>反查与正查共用一套图</strong>，结果绑定事件级证据链并留查询快照；显式保留 <code>unknown_consumer</code> 未知边。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>溯源图谱系是信号研判判决之后的执行层：上游如何把信号归一化成统一实体、如何做实体消解与强度加权，见 <a href=\"safety-signal-source-taxonomy\">安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型</a>；下游如何依据受影响范围与严重度决定强制召回还是自愿召回、责任如何在平台-卖家-供应商间分配，见 <a href=\"../recall-regime-liability-model/mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism\">强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询","id":"批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：批次标识、谱系边与溯源图","id":"核心概念-批次标识-谱系边与溯源图"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系建模：从批次表到可遍历的图","id":"谱系建模-从批次表到可遍历的图"},{"level":2,"text":"受影响范围查询：图遍历与爆炸半径","id":"受影响范围查询-图遍历与爆炸半径"},{"level":2,"text":"跨法域追溯合规：记录哪些边、留多久","id":"跨法域追溯合规-记录哪些边-留多久"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"危害风险评分、分级研判与召回触发管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/hazard-risk-scoring-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"受影响范围识别：批次、在途、库存与买家订单定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/crossborder-recall-execution/recall-scope-affected-population-identification"}}